OpenFlights Airport and Route Databases
---------------------------------------

Datasets: air_routes (18,930 pairs of airports joined by a nonstop route)
and airports (3,257 airports with at least one such route). Both are
derivative databases of the OpenFlights route and airport databases and
are offered under the same licence.

