A 2014 snapshot: the publisher warns that "The third-party that OpenFlights
uses for route data ceased providing updates in June 2014. The current data
is of historical value only." The routes are the routes of June 2014; the
airport names and positions are as the airport database was last revised
(2019). A route names its airports by IATA code, and each code is drawn at
the airport that holds it in that database, so a code that has moved since
2014 (Istanbul's IST, now the new airport) is drawn at today's airport, a
few tens of kilometres from the old one.

